  "description": "Core abstractions for the OrchestratR library, a lightweight .NET mediator implementation supporting CQRS and event-driven patterns. Defines the foundational interfaces for request/response processing, notification dispatching, and pipeline interception. Includes contracts for command and query handlers, notification subscribers, and middleware components. Designed for modern .NET applications targeting .NET 8 and .NET 9 with minimal dependencies.",
